    <article class="page-content">
      <p><em><span class="tr_" data-orig="DinWeys is a registered trademark in China of Zhangjiakou Dingwei Biotech Co." data-source="" id="tr_1">DinWeys is a registered trademark in China of Zhangjiakou Dingwei Biotech Co.</span>, Ltd.</em></p>
      <p><span class="tr_" data-orig="We have changed our trading name from XION to DinWeys in" data-source="" id="tr_2">We have changed our trading name from XION to DinWeys in</span> 2024</p>
      <p><strong>Dinweys Biotech Co., Ltd.</strong> <span class="tr_" data-orig="is a manufacturing and service enterprise established as a joint venture by investors from China" data-source="" id="tr_9">is a manufacturing and service enterprise established as a joint venture by investors from China</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="New Zealand" data-source="" id="tr_10">New Zealand</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="and Taiwan" data-source="" id="tr_11">and Taiwan</span>. <span class="tr_" data-orig="While we offer a diverse range of agricultural solutions" data-source="" id="tr_12">While we offer a diverse range of agricultural solutions</span>, nosso <strong><span class="tr_" data-orig="core expertise lies in deep-processed potato products" data-source="" id="tr_13">core expertise lies in deep-processed potato products</span></strong>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="specifically" data-source="" id="tr_14">specifically</span> <strong>Flocos de Batata, Batatas fritas congeladas, <span class="tr_" data-orig="and Potato Starch" data-source="" id="tr_15">and Potato Starch</span></strong>.</p>
      <p><span class="tr_" data-orig="Strategically located in Zhangjiakou City" data-source="" id="tr_16">Strategically located in Zhangjiakou City</span>, Província de Hebei (160<span class="tr_" data-orig="km from Beijing" data-source="" id="tr_17">km from Beijing</span>)<span class="tr_" data-orig="—a region known for premium agriculture—we also leverage local resources to supply high-quality" data-source="" id="tr_18">—a region known for premium agriculture—we also leverage local resources to supply high-quality</span> <strong>linhaça, Quinoa, <span class="tr_" data-orig="and oat series" data-source="" id="tr_19">and oat series</span></strong>. <span class="tr_" data-orig="We utilize advanced processing techniques" data-source="" id="tr_20">We utilize advanced processing techniques</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="including drum drying" data-source="" id="tr_21">including drum drying</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="freeze-drying" data-source="" id="tr_22">freeze-drying</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="extrusion" data-source="" id="tr_23">extrusion</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="and low-temperature processing" data-source="" id="tr_24">and low-temperature processing</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="to create superior ingredients" data-source="" id="tr_25">to create superior ingredients</span>.</p>
      <p><span class="tr_" data-orig="With an additional operations branch in North Shore" data-source="" id="tr_26">With an additional operations branch in North Shore</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="Auckland" data-source="" id="tr_27">Auckland</span> (<span class="tr_" data-orig="New Zealand" data-source="" id="tr_28">New Zealand</span>), <span class="tr_" data-orig="we are positioned to serve the global market efficiently" data-source="" id="tr_29">we are positioned to serve the global market efficiently</span>. <span class="tr_" data-orig="Whether you are a top-tier international brand or a growing SME" data-source="" id="tr_30">Whether you are a top-tier international brand or a growing SME</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="we provide stable" data-source="" id="tr_31">we provide stable</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="reliable" data-source="" id="tr_32">reliable</span>, <span class="tr_" data-orig="and cost-effective ingredient solutions tailored to your needs" data-source="" id="tr_33">and cost-effective ingredient solutions tailored to your needs</span>.</p>
